# An ordinary turn under a working message an extension wrote.
# `ctx.ui.setWorkingMessage` replaces the vendor's own word with whatever the
# extension likes and leaves the rest of the row alone, so nothing about this
# screen says `Working...` and a turn is running on it all the same. The agent
# is still there afterwards, the way pi is: whoever is driving this scenario
# decides when it ends.
screen boot
sleep 50
screen renamed
sleep 600000
